# Pinned llama.cpp release for the bundled local model runtime.
#
# Umbratic builds `llama-server` from this exact commit during desktop
# packaging; nothing is downloaded from a release page. Bump both fields
# together and deliberately — a new tag is a supply-chain review, not a
# routine dependency update.
#
# Floor: any release from mid-April 2026 or later. The Qwen3-ASR projector
# landed in ggml-org/llama.cpp#19441 and `/v1/audio/transcriptions` in
# ggml-org/llama.cpp#21863; dictation does not work on anything older.
